# An invite link is /i/<code> (InviteLinks.kt). Every code is served the one
# page, which reads the code from the address; 200 makes it a rewrite, so the
# address bar keeps the code. The second line takes the same link with a
# trailing slash, which some mail clients and people add.
/i/:code  /invite  200
/i/:code/  /invite  200
